a given move (m1,... ,m d) begins. So xk = 0 in the General Square Decomposition corresponds to
the critical start vertex. Intermediate vertices refer to the vertices that are used along the way
in defining the edges that end up in the edge set for a given move ( m1,... ,m d). Hence, given our
